<Tag Name="PLCFault" TagType="Base" DataType="FaultRecordType" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[PLC Major Fault Record]]>
</Description>
<Comments>
<Comment Operand=".TIMELOW">
<![CDATA[Lower 32 bits of the fault timestamp value]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".TIMEHIGH">
<![CDATA[Upper 32 bits of the fault timestamp value]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".RECTYPE">
<![CDATA[Fault Type]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CODE">
<![CDATA[Unique code for the fault]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".INFO">
<![CDATA[Fault specific information]]>
</Comment>
</Comments>
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,0,0,0,[2,7162,26809,931612,0,0,0,0]]]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
<Structure DataType="FaultRecordType">
<DataValueMember Name="TimeLow" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="TimeHigh" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="RecType" DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<DataValueMember Name="Code" DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
<ArrayMember Name="Info" DataType="DINT" Dimensions="8" Radix="Decimal">
<Element Index="[0]" Value="2"/>
<Element Index="[1]" Value="7162"/>
<Element Index="[2]" Value="26809"/>
<Element Index="[3]" Value="931612"/>
<Element Index="[4]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[5]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[6]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[7]" Value="0"/>
</ArrayMember>
</Structure>
</Data>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="YA10" TagType="Alias" AliasFor="DigitalPoint[59]" ExternalAccess="Read/Write"/>
</Tags>
<Programs Use="Context">
<Program Use="Context" Name="MainProgram">
<Tags Use="Context">
<Tag Name="Address" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Temp Address used in Time Loop]]>
</Description>
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[9]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="9"/>
</Data>
</Tag>
</Tags>
<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Target" Name="FaultRoutine" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================================================================================================================
                                                              Program Fault routine : used to trap the major fault due to the execution of an instruction faults in the program MainProgram

                                                    List of treatments handled by the routine :
                                                         - Get the Major Fault record information
                                                         - Action due to Major Fault
                                                    -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    History 
		2019-DEC-24 - Merck - Q. Spindler - Initial version for Candidate Release 1.00.00.00.a
==========================================================================================================================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Get the Major fault record information
==========================================================================================================================================================
Use Get System Value instruction to save the fault information in PLC Fault structure.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GSV(Program,THIS,MAJORFAULTRECORD,PLCFault.TimeLow);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Action due to Major Fault
==========================================================================================================================================================
If the error is an execution of an instruction faults (Fault type = 4) during prescan, activating the alarm PLC Program Major Fault.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(CPU_Scanning)EQU(PLCFault.RecType,4)[OTL(YA10.Alarm) ,OTL(AlarmControl.Current) ,OTL(Phase0.Hold) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the error is an execution of an instruction faults (Fault type = 4), activating the alarm PLC Program Major Fault.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(PLCFault.RecType,4)[OTL(YA10.Alarm) ,OTL(AlarmControl.Current) ,OTL(Phase0.Hold) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset Temp Address]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(0,Address);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Use="Reference" Name="MainRoutine">
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
